00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:32.320
pay, but you will receive this

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:35.560
discounted rate. So, starting July 1st,

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:36.280
2026, you should see your payments go

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:39.120
down. [music]

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.520
Now, with this option, if you are not

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:45.160
