00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:49.400
July 1st to of 2026 all the way up to

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:52.240
September 30th of 2026 to receive this

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:54.720
reduction if you sign up for auto pay in

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:57.400
