00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:28.920
So, this is a positive change from the

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:30.959
Trump administration and if you can, you

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:33.120
want to take advantage if you have

00:02:30.959 --> 00:02:35.959
