be the best time if you want to get a

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:19.959
home. The third major change is the

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:21.720
collection of medical debt. Senate

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:23.760
Republicans just blocked Democrat

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:26.080
